 RAD A  *DS3                                WINDOW(MSGCTL)
 RAD A  *DS4                                WINDOW(MSGCTL)
 RAD A N88                                  DSPMOD(*DS4)
 RAD A                                      OVERLAY
 RAD A            $$FKEY16      18A  O 13  1
 RAD A                                      COLOR(BLU)
